{"id":"dispatch-text-v1-single-summary","source":"public-synthetic","input":{"text":"把下面这段公开项目记录整理成简洁摘要，突出进度、风险和下一步：社区故事活动场地已确认，海报未完成，志愿者名单周五确认，雨天需要室内备用场地。只整理我提供的文字，不读取文件、相册或日记，不做页面，也不增加无关协作者。","language":"zh","fixture":"all-supported","resolvedReferences":[]},"expected":{"type":"workspace","capabilities":[{"agentId":"file-preprocessor","capability":"text.summarize"}],"requiredAny":[]},"tags":["text","single-specialist","no-site","no-private-data","initial-dispatch"]}
{"id":"dispatch-text-v1-story-to-video","source":"public-synthetic","input":{"text":"把这段公开故事先写成文字分镜，再基于分镜写30秒视频脚本：阿禾错过末班车，父亲骑车接她，两人把多余雨伞送给路人。脚本延续分镜事件顺序。只交付文字，不查素材，不做页面、漫画图片或视频成片。","language":"zh","fixture":"all-supported","resolvedReferences":[]},"expected":{"type":"workspace","capabilities":[{"agentId":"comic-diary","capability":"comic.storyboard"},{"agentId":"video-production","capability":"video.script"}],"requiredAny":[]},"tags":["text","typed-handoff","no-site","initial-dispatch"]}
{"id":"dispatch-text-v1-parallel-synthesis","source":"public-synthetic","input":{"text":"围绕公开故事分别做文字分镜和主角形象建议：年轻修伞师阿禾在雨天帮邻居修好旧伞。两个方案独立制作，再由管家汇总两份成果为简洁创作方案，指出冲突设定。不读取私人资料，不查素材，不做页面、最终图片或视频。","language":"zh","fixture":"all-supported","resolvedReferences":[]},"expected":{"type":"workspace","capabilities":[{"agentId":"comic-diary","capability":"comic.storyboard"},{"agentId":"virtual-character","capability":"character.advise"},{"agentId":"miaoxun-butler","capability":"text.synthesize"}],"requiredAny":[]},"tags":["text","parallel","explicit-synthesis","no-site","initial-dispatch"]}
{"id":"dispatch-text-v1-single-video-script","source":"public-synthetic","input":{"text":"直接为一家公开虚构的街角修伞店写30秒视频脚本，表现雨天收旧伞、修补、交还三个场景。只要文字，不先写漫画分镜、不查相册、不做页面、不渲染成片。一个专业助手足够，不要为展示协作多加任务。","language":"zh","fixture":"all-supported","resolvedReferences":[]},"expected":{"type":"workspace","capabilities":[{"agentId":"video-production","capability":"video.script"}],"requiredAny":[]},"tags":["text","single-specialist","no-unnecessary-agent","no-site","initial-dispatch"]}
